mixtures, $\mathrm{H}_{2}\mathrm{O}$ can participate in the reaction of $\mathrm{CO}_{2}$ with an amine, often leading to the formation of ammonium bicarbonate and an overall amine: $\mathrm{CO}_{2}$ stoichiometry of 1:1 (Scheme 2).63
